       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           TTRNSINQ.
       AUTHOR.               K MOVSESIAN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         MAR 7, 1988.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   T T R N S I N Q   TRANSACTION INQUIRY (CSAS)      (SAQ1) *
      *    THIS PROGRAM IS AN ONLINE INQUIRY PROGRAM WHICH LISTS   *
      *    ALL THE DETAIL TRANSACTION FOR THE MONTH.  THE USER     *
      *    CAN VIEW ALL THE TRANSACTION FOR EITHER A CORPORATE     *
      *    CODE OR A PURCHASE ORDER NUMBER.  THE USER ALSO HAS THE *
      *    OPTION TO VIEW OTHER OPEN TRANSACTION THAT ARE NOT      *
      *    TRANSACTIONS FOR THE CURRENT MONTH.  GENERALLY THESE    *
      *    ARE OPEN INVOICE AND RECEIPT TRANSACTIONS.              *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      * C O M M E N T S                                            *
      *                                                            *
      * 10/17/1994        C A ZUBEK                                *
      * ADDED A CALL TO THE SUBROUTINE "TALTKEY" TO ALLOW THE USER *
      * TO TYPE IN AN ALTERNATE KEY.  THE VALUE OF THE CORPORATE   *
      * CODE CORRESPONDING TO THE ALTERNATE KEY IS RETURNED FROM   *
      * THE SUBROUTINE.                                            *
      *                                                            *
      * INCREASED THE SIZE OF THE ENTRY SCREEN CORPORATE CODE      *
      * FIELD TO ALLOW FOR THE 12-BYTE ALTERNATE KEY FIELD.        *
      *                                                            *
      * ALSO ADDED THE READ STATEMENT FOR MATLACCUM SO THAT THE    *
      * CLASS FIELD DISPLAYS ON SCREEN.  (REQ #6281)               *
      *                                                            *
      *C*  06/21/1996    CA YODER                                  *
      *C*    RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.      *
      *C*                                                          *
      **************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.      IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.      IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.        I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZTRNSINQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT MATLACCUM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DTRANS-I-CDE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DTRANS-I-PO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0703
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC           PIC X(2000).
       FD  MATLACCUM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MATLACCUM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0601.
       FD  DTRANS-I-CDE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-REC-I-CDE.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0701.
       FD  DTRANS-I-PO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-REC-I-PO.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0703.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 EOJ-SW                        PIC X(1)       VALUE SPACES.
       77 FATAL-ERR-SW                  PIC X(1)       VALUE SPACES.
       77 ERR-SW                        PIC X(1)       VALUE SPACES.
       77  RET-CODE-TALTKEY             PIC X(2)       VALUE "00".
       77  BASE-TALTKEY                 PIC X(20).
       77  ALT-KEY-ARG                  PIC X(40).
       77  ALT-CORP-CODE                PIC X(8).
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X          VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X          VALUE SPACES.
       01  RELATIVE-RECNO               PIC 9(9).
       01  SAVE-CLASS                   PIC X(4)       VALUE SPACES.

      **********************************************************
      **   VIEW PARAMETERS                                    **
      **********************************************************

       COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.

       01  FORMFILE.
           05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FTRNSINQ".
           05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
           05  FORM-GNAME.
               10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
               10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.

       01  FORM-NAMES.
           05  INQ-HEADER                PIC X(8)  VALUE "TRANSHDR".
           05  INQ-TRANS                 PIC X(8)  VALUE "TRANSINQ".

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT              PIC X(64)    VALUE SPACE.
           05  MSG-FLD               PIC X(12)    VALUE SPACE.
           05  MSG-FLD-9  REDEFINES  MSG-FLD      PIC Z(11)9.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76    COMP-4.

       01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO  COMP-4.

       01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1     COMP-4.
      *************************************************************
      **    PARAMETER AREA FOR DISPLAY SCREENS                   **
      *************************************************************
       COPY DISPDATA   IN COPYLIB.
       01  COMMAND-AREA.
           05  OVERRIDE-ZTRNSINQ      PIC X(34) VALUE
               "OVRDSPF FILE(ZTRNSINQ) SHARE(*YES)".
           05  OVERRIDE-PARM2         PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 34.

      *************************************************************
      **         D A T A  E N T R Y  B U F F E R S               **
      *************************************************************

       01  SCREEN-1.
           05  DE1-MATL-CODE            PIC X(12).
           05  DE1-PO-NUMBER.
               10  DE1-PO-NUM           PIC X(7).
               10  DE1-PO-RLS           PIC X(3).
           05  DE1-VIEW-ALL-TC-SW       PIC X(1).
           05  DE1-COMMAND-LINE         PIC X(79).
           05  DE1-MESSAGE-LINE         PIC X(79).

       01  SUBFILE-CONTROL.
           05  SC-HEADER-LINE-1         PIC X(40).
           05  SC-HEADER-LINE-2         PIC X(18).
           05  SC-DESC                  PIC X(79).
           05  SC-PO-CODE-LIT           PIC X(10).

       01  DISP-SUBFILE.
           05  DS-DETAIL-LINE           PIC X(79).

       01  HDR-LINE1.
           05 CODE-PO-LIT   PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 DISP-CODE-PO  PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER        PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 DISP-CLASS-LIT  PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 DISP-CLASS      PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  HDR-LINE2.
           05 DESCR-LIT     PIC X(18)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  HDR-LINE3.
           05 DESCR-OUT     PIC X(79)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  DETAIL-LINE1.
           05 DIS-TC-CODE               PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-QTY                   PIC Z(9)9- VALUE ZEROS.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-VALUE                 PIC Z(11)9.99- VALUE ZEROS.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-PO-OR-CODE            PIC X(11) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-RCVR                  PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-ITEM-NO               PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-ACCT                  PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-DEPT                  PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-TC-DATE               PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-UM                    PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       01  DETAIL-LINE2.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-BAL-QTY               PIC Z(10)- VALUE ZEROS.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DIS-DOC-NUM               PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.

       01  F3-MSG.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.

       01  F4-MSG.
           05 FILLER                    PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.

       01  F3-LABEL-KEY                 PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.

       01  F4-LABEL-KEY                 PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.


      ************************************************************
      **                                                        **
      **           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S              **
      **                                                        **
      ************************************************************

       COPY MATLACUM IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DTRANS   IN COPYLIB.

      **********************************************************
      *              D A T A    B A S E                        *
      **********************************************************

       COPY DBCSACCT IN COPYLIB.

       01  STORES-BASE          PIC X(12)   VALUE "  STORES;".
       01  STORES-PASSWORD      PIC X(8)    VALUE "JADE; ".

       COPY DBMODES  IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DBSTAT   IN COPYLIB.

       01  DATASET-NAMES.
           05  DSET-MMATL-ACCUM PIC X(16)  VALUE "MMATL-ACCUM;".
           05  DSET-DTRANS      PIC X(16)  VALUE "DTRANS;".

       01  ITEMS-LISTING.
           05  ALL-ITEMS        PIC X(2)   VALUE "@;".
           05  MATL-KEY         PIC X(10)  VALUE "MATL-CODE;".
           05  PO-KEY           PIC X(10)  VALUE "PO-NUMBER;".

       01  IMAGE-ARGS.
           05  MATL-ARG         PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PO-ARG           PIC X(10)  VALUE SPACES.

      *******************************
      **  PARAMETERS FOR CALLING
      **  'CDESC'
      *******************************

       COPY CDESC IN COPYLIB.

       01  RET-CODE                     PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.

      ********************************
      **   PARAMETERS FOR CALLING   **
      **   'TDATECHK'               **
      ********************************

       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGUAGE IN COPYLIB.

       COPY CATREAD  IN COPYLIB.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      ***************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       001-BEGIN SECTION.

       BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-H-X.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.

           PERFORM 2-EOJ  THRU 2-EOJ-X.

           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN INPUT MATLACCUM-I, DTRANS-I-CDE, DTRANS-I-PO.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVERRIDE-ZTRNSINQ, OVERRIDE-PARM2.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.

      *     PREVIOUS ENTRIES
           MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE 128 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO F3-LABEL-KEY.
      *     MORE DATA
           MOVE  13 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE  45 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO F4-LABEL-KEY.
      *     PRESS 'f3' TO SEE PREVIOUS DATA
           MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE 131 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO F3-MSG.
      *     PRESS 'f4' TO SEE MORE DATA
           MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE 132 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO F4-MSG.

       1-H-X.
           EXIT.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE MATLACCUM-I, DTRANS-I-CDE, DTRANS-I-PO.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.

       2-EOJ-X.
            EXIT.

      ******************************************************
      **                                                  **
      **   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
      **                                                  **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TTRNSINQ"              TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING ACCTG-BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       2-BLOWUP-X.
           EXIT.

       4-PGM-ERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(99), IND(FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE1-MESSAGE-LINE.

       4-PGM-ERROR-X.
           EXIT.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *     6 - M A I N                                *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 61-PROCESS-SCREEN-1  THRU  61-PS1-X.
           IF EOJ-SW = "Y"
               GO TO 6-M-X.

           PERFORM 62-PROCESS-SCREEN-2  THRU  62-PS2-X.
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       6-M-X.
           EXIT.



       61-PROCESS-SCREEN-1.
           MOVE INQ-HEADER              TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES                  TO  SCREEN-1.
           MOVE ZEROS                   TO  DE1-PO-RLS.

       61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.
           MOVE SCREEN-1                TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC             TO  SCREEN-1.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               MOVE "Y"                 TO  EOJ-SW
               GO TO 61-PS1-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *        "* INVALID FUNCTION KEY ENTERED *"
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 2  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

           IF DE1-MATL-CODE = SPACES AND DE1-PO-NUM = SPACES
      *** ENTER EITHER MATERIAL CODE OR PO NUMBER
               MOVE 66327 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 2  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

       61-EDIT-DATA.
           MOVE "N"                     TO ERR-SW.
           IF DE1-MATL-CODE = SPACES
               PERFORM 611-EDIT-PO-NUMBER
           ELSE
               PERFORM 611-EDIT-MATL-CODE.
           IF ERR-SW = "Y"
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

       61-PS1-X.
           EXIT.

       611-EDIT-PO-NUMBER.
           MOVE DE1-PO-NUMBER           TO PO-ARG,
                                           BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PONUM OF DTRANS-REC-I-PO.
           START DTRANS-I-PO KEY = PONUM OF DTRANS-REC-I-PO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *            "PURCHASE ORDER DOES NOT EXIST"
                   MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE  45 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MSG-TEXT
                   MOVE PO-ARG         TO  MSG-FLD
                   MOVE 4              TO  FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                   MOVE "Y"            TO ERR-SW
               ELSE
                   MOVE "START DTRANS * 611-EPN" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

       611-EDIT-MATL-CODE.
           MOVE DE1-MATL-CODE           TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                                           ALT-KEY-ARG.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *  10/18/94           C A ZUBEK                             *
      *  LOGIC TO CALL THE SUBROUTINE "TALTKEY" TO SEE IF USER    *
      *  ENTERED AN ALTERNATE KEY.  IF SO, THE CORPORATE CODE     *
      *  WILL BE RETURNED.                                        *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

           CALL "TALTKEY" USING RET-CODE-TALTKEY,
                                BASE-TALTKEY,
                                STATUS-AREA,
                                ALT-KEY-ARG,
                                ALT-CORP-CODE.
           IF RET-CODE-TALTKEY NOT EQUAL "00"
               MOVE "TALTKEY ERROR 611-EMC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE ALT-CORP-CODE           TO MATL-ARG
                                           DE1-MATL-CODE.

           MOVE MATL-ARG TO MATLCODE OF MATLACCUM-REC-I.
           START MATLACCUM-I KEY = MATLCODE OF MATLACCUM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                READ MATLACCUM-I NEXT INTO BUF-MATLACUM
                    AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                END-READ
                MOVE MATL-CLASS             TO SAVE-CLASS
           ELSE
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *            "MATERIAL CODE DOES NOT EXIST"
                   MOVE 13  TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 56  TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MSG-TEXT
                   MOVE MATL-ARG       TO  MSG-FLD
                   MOVE 2              TO  FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                   MOVE "Y"            TO ERR-SW
               ELSE
                   MOVE "START MATLACCUM * 611-EMC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

       62-PROCESS-SCREEN-2.
           MOVE SPACES                  TO  SUBFILE-CONTROL,
                                            HDR-LINE1,
                                            HDR-LINE2,
                                            HDR-LINE3.
           IF DE1-MATL-CODE = SPACES
               PERFORM 621-LOAD-PO-HDR
           ELSE
               PERFORM 621-LOAD-CODE-HDR.
           MOVE HDR-LINE1               TO  SC-HEADER-LINE-1.
           MOVE HDR-LINE2               TO  SC-HEADER-LINE-2.
           MOVE HDR-LINE3               TO  SC-DESC.
           PERFORM 810-CLEAR-SUBFILE THRU 810-EXIT.
           MOVE 0                       TO  RELATIVE-RECNO.

       62-PUT-BUFFER.
           IF DE1-MATL-CODE NOT = SPACES
                MOVE DE1-MATL-CODE TO MATL-ARG
                MOVE MATL-ARG      TO MATLCODE OF DTRANS-REC-I-CDE
                START DTRANS-I-CDE KEY = MATLCODE  OF DTRANS-REC-I-CDE
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                END-START
                IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE SPACES TO DISP-SUBFILE
      *           NO ENTRIES QUALIFIED
                   MOVE 14   TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 116  TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DS-DETAIL-LINE
                   MOVE DISP-SUBFILE   TO DISPLAY-REC
                   ADD  1              TO RELATIVE-RECNO
                   WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSF"
                         INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS
                ELSE
                    PERFORM 621-GET-DTRANS-ENTRIES THRU 621-EXIT
           ELSE
               PERFORM 621-GET-DTRANS-ENTRIES THRU 621-EXIT.


           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSB"
                 INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(76).
           IF RELATIVE-RECNO > ZERO
                MOVE B"1" TO IND(75)
           ELSE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(75).
           MOVE SUBFILE-CONTROL TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSC"
                 INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT "RDSC"
                 INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

       62-PS2-X.
           EXIT.


       621-LOAD-PO-HDR.
      *        PURCHASE ORDER
           MOVE 16  TO LANG-SETNUM
           MOVE 129 TO LANG-MSGNUM
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO CODE-PO-LIT.
      *        CODE
           MOVE 3   TO LANG-SETNUM
           MOVE 179 TO LANG-MSGNUM
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO SC-PO-CODE-LIT.
           MOVE DE1-PO-NUMBER           TO DISP-CODE-PO.


       621-LOAD-CODE-HDR.
           MOVE SAVE-CLASS              TO DISP-CLASS.
           MOVE DE1-MATL-CODE           TO DISP-CODE-PO.

      *        STORES CODE
           MOVE 19  TO LANG-SETNUM
           MOVE 39  TO LANG-MSGNUM
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO CODE-PO-LIT.
      *        DESCRIPTION
           MOVE 4   TO LANG-SETNUM
           MOVE 34  TO LANG-MSGNUM
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO DESCR-LIT.
      *        CLASS
           MOVE 3   TO LANG-SETNUM
           MOVE 178 TO LANG-MSGNUM
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO DISP-CLASS-LIT.
      *        PO NUMBER
           MOVE 16  TO LANG-SETNUM
           MOVE 130 TO LANG-MSGNUM
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO SC-PO-CODE-LIT.

      ************************************************************
      *  THIS SUBROUTINE WILL GET THE MATERIAL CODE DESCRIPTION  *
      ************************************************************

           MOVE "01"                    TO CDESC-LINES-TO-GET.
           MOVE "N"                     TO CDESC-LOCAL-DESC-OPTION.
           CALL "CDESC" USING RET-CODE, STORES-BASE, STATUS-AREA,
               BU-DISPLAY-MSG, MATL-ARG, CDESC-DATA.
           MOVE CDESC (1)               TO DESCR-OUT.

       621-GET-DTRANS-ENTRIES.
           IF DE1-MATL-CODE NOT = SPACES
               READ DTRANS-I-CDE NEXT INTO BUF-DTRANS
                   AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
           ELSE
               READ DTRANS-I-PO NEXT INTO BUF-DTRANS
                   AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO 621-EXIT
               ELSE
                   MOVE "GET DTRANS * 621-GDE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
           ELSE
               IF TRANS-DOCUMENT-NUM = "PROC"
                   IF DE1-VIEW-ALL-TC-SW = "X"
                       NEXT SENTENCE
                   ELSE
                       GO TO 621-GET-DTRANS-ENTRIES.

           IF DE1-MATL-CODE NOT = SPACES
               IF MATLCODE OF DTRANS-REC-I-CDE NOT = MATL-ARG
                   GO TO 621-EXIT
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               IF PONUM OF DTRANS-REC-I-PO NOT = PO-ARG
                   GO TO 621-EXIT.

       621-LOAD-DATA.
           MOVE SPACES              TO DETAIL-LINE1,
                                       DETAIL-LINE2.
           MOVE TRANS-CODE          TO DIS-TC-CODE.
           MOVE TRANS-QTY           TO DIS-QTY.
           MOVE TRANS-VALUE         TO DIS-VALUE.
           MOVE TRANS-RCVR-NUM      TO DIS-RCVR.
           MOVE TRANS-ITEM-NUM      TO DIS-ITEM-NO.
           MOVE TRANS-ACCT          TO DIS-ACCT.
           MOVE TRANS-DEPT          TO DIS-DEPT.
           MOVE 4                   TO DATE-MODE.
           MOVE TRANS-DATE          TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
           CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
           MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT      TO DIS-TC-DATE.
           MOVE TRANS-UNIT-MEASURE  TO DIS-UM.
           MOVE TRANS-BALANCE-QTY   TO DIS-BAL-QTY.
           MOVE TRANS-DOCUMENT-NUM  TO DIS-DOC-NUM.
           IF DE1-MATL-CODE = SPACES
               MOVE TRANS-STORES-CODE TO DIS-PO-OR-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE TRANS-PO-NUM      TO DIS-PO-OR-CODE.

           MOVE SPACES                TO DISP-SUBFILE.
           MOVE DETAIL-LINE1          TO DS-DETAIL-LINE.
           MOVE DISP-SUBFILE          TO DISPLAY-REC.
           ADD  1                     TO RELATIVE-RECNO.
           WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSF"
                 INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

           MOVE SPACES                TO DISP-SUBFILE.
           MOVE DETAIL-LINE2          TO DS-DETAIL-LINE.
           MOVE DISP-SUBFILE          TO DISPLAY-REC.
           ADD  1                     TO RELATIVE-RECNO.
           WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSF"
                 INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

           GO TO 621-GET-DTRANS-ENTRIES.

       621-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       810-CLEAR-SUBFILE.
           MOVE B"0" TO IND(75), IND(76).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(77).
           MOVE SUBFILE-CONTROL TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSC" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE B"0" TO IND(77).
           MOVE ZERO TO RELATIVE-RECNO.

       810-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.

       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
